T1  - Geographic patterns of hepatocellular carcinoma mortality with exposure to iron in groundwater in Taiwanese population: an ecological study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/1471-2458-13-352
A1  - Shyu, Horng-Jeng
A1  - Lung, Chia-Chi
A1  - Ho, Chien-Chang
A1  - Sun, Yi-Hua Iris
A1  - Ko, Pei-Chieh
