T1  - Managing complex respiratory patients in the community: an evaluation of a pilot integrated respiratory care service.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/bmjresp-2016-000145
A1  - Gillett, K
A1  - Lippiett, K
A1  - Astles, C
A1  - Longstaff, J
