T1  - Detection of previously undiagnosed cases of COPD in a high-risk population identified in general practice.
T3  - Comment in: COPD. 2012 Aug;9(5):443-4. doi: 10.3109/15412555.2012.718925 PMID: 22946826 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/22946826]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3109/15412555.2012.685118
A1  - Lokke, Anders
A1  - Ulrik, Charlotte Suppli
A1  - Dahl, Ronald
A1  - Plauborg, Liane
A1  - Dollerup, Jens
