T1  - Chemical and spatial analysis of protein loaded PLGA microspheres for drug delivery applications.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jconrel.2012.05.008
A1  - Rafati, A
A1  - Boussahel, A
A1  - Shakesheff, K M
A1  - Shard, A G
A1  - Roberts, C J
