T1  - Longitudinal predictors of health-related quality of life in middle-aged and older adults with hypertension: results of a population-based study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1097/HJH.0b013e328353d81b
A1  - Maatouk, Imad
A1  - Wild, Beate
