T1  - Use of the community viral load as a population-based biomarker of HIV burden.
T3  - Comment in: AIDS. 2012 Jul 31;26(12):1577-8; authors reply 1578-9. doi: 10.1097/QAD.0b013e328354f58a PMID: 22810371 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/22810371]
