T1  - Preventing disease through opportunistic, rapid engagement by primary care teams using behaviour change counselling (PRE-EMPT): protocol for a general practice-based cluster randomised trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/1471-2296-11-69
A1  - Spanou, Clio
A1  - Simpson, Sharon A
A1  - Hood, Kerry
A1  - Edwards, Adrian
A1  - Cohen, David
