T1  - Predictors of accuracy of diagnosis of chronic obstructive pulmonary disease in general practice.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.5694/j.1326-5377.2011.tb03271.x
A1  - Zwar, Nicholas A
A1  - Marks, Guy B
A1  - Hermiz, Oshana
