T1  - A composite scoring of genotypes discriminates coronary heart disease risk beyond conventional risk factors in the Boston Puerto Rican Health Study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.numecd.2009.03.016
A1  - Junyent, M
A1  - Tucker, K L
A1  - Shen, J
A1  - Lee, Y-C
