T1  - Audit on cardiovascular disease preventive care in general practice.
T3  - Comment in: Singapore Med J. 2008 Nov;49(11):956-7; author reply 957-8. PMID: 19037566 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/19037566]
A1  - Chan, S C
