T1  - Evidence-based guidelines for management of attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder in adolescents in transition to adult services and in adults: recommendations from the British Association for Psychopharmacology.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1177/0269881106073219
A1  - Nutt, D J
