T1  - Symptomatic peripheral arterial disease: the value of a validated questionnaire and a clinical decision rule.
A1  - Bendermacher, Bianca Lw
A1  - Teijink, Joep Aw
A1  - Willigendael, Edith M
A1  - Bartelink, Marie-Louise
A1  - Buller, Harry R
