T3  - Comment in: Med J Aust. 2002 Apr 1;176(7):303-4. doi: 10.5694/j.1326-5377.2002.tb04427.x PMID: 12013318 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/12013318] Comment in: Med J Aust. 2002 Oct 7;177(7):398-9; author reply 399. doi: 10.5694/j.1326-5377.2002.tb04857.x PMID: 12358593 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/12358593]
