T1  - Do undefined sources of hepatitis C transmission exist? The Greek study in General Practice.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1046/j.1365-2893.2000.00217.x
A1  - Lionis, C
A1  - Vlachonikolis, I G
A1  - Skliros, S
A1  - Symeonidis, A
A1  - Merkouris, B P
A1  - Kouroumalis, E
